Copyright 2026 Mantra Patel, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

This project is a re-implementation/adaptation in a single dependency-free JavaScript file.
Changes: rewritten as a standalone module, simplified (raymarched terrain instead of mesh,
reduced grass/particle systems), local-clock time of day, and other modifications.
Constants, colour keyframes and the rendering pipeline structure follow the original.
